	<title><![CDATA[Oil India dividend, Q2 results 2026: PSU giant announces interim payout as profit more than doubles - Check record date]]></title>
	
	<link><![CDATA[https://www.livemint.com/market/stock-market-news/oil-india-dividend-q2-results-2026-psu-giant-announces-interim-payout-as-profit-more-than-doubles-check-record-date-11794486825501.html]]></link>
	
	<description><![CDATA[Oil India’s standalone Q2 FY27 net profit more than doubled year over year to  ₹2,259.42 crore, while revenue rose to  ₹8,071.33 crore. The board approved an interim dividend of  ₹7 per share, with November 20 as the record date.]]></description>
	
