<item>
	<title><![CDATA[Up in 8 of last 10 sessions, HDFC Bank share price jumps 22% in this period - Why should you still buy the bank stock?]]></title>
	
	<link><![CDATA[https://www.livemint.com/market/stock-market-news/up-in-8-of-last-10-sessions-hdfc-bank-share-price-jumps-22-in-this-period-why-should-you-still-buy-the-bank-stock-11794471982939.html]]></link>
	
	<description><![CDATA[HDFC Bank shares have rebounded about 22% from their 52-week low in 10 trading sessions, adding roughly  ₹2.2 lakh crore to market value. Analysts cite improving operations and resilient asset quality, while cautioning that a decisive close above  ₹820 is needed to confirm further momentum.]]></description>
	
